00:40.763 --> 00:53.353
[SPEAKER_00]: Means that in the future it's possible he could realize that his loyalty lives with the Sea Principality and the Prince of Toli is actually the one that is more dangerous than Jeon.

00:53.974 --> 00:57.457
[SPEAKER_00]: And that this game he's playing weakens himself.

00:57.677 --> 01:02.501
