[SPEAKER_01]: How is Monmurg set?

01:07.878 --> 01:16.220
[SPEAKER_01]: I mean, just on the embargo, food, are we suffering mass desertions?

01:16.281 --> 01:17.081
[SPEAKER_01]: Are we able to keep...

