01:47.814 --> 01:50.816
[SPEAKER_00]: I may send you as an envoy to talk to him in the future.

01:57.075 --> 02:11.245
[SPEAKER_00]: Again, I believe that not only is Fairwind and Jeon being played by the Toli, I have a feeling that the Sea Principalities and Keoland itself are being played by other nefarious forces as well.

02:12.085 --> 02:13.126
